release: signs every release, as the release environment's PRYXD_RELEASE_KEY.
-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
MCowBQYDK2VwAyEAzN0KntU+EeMI4rSYn1KfBsJp9nG66oqVB5ciz+E+ydo=
