recovery: signs nothing day to day; it signs the release that replaces the
release key if that key is lost or leaks.
-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
MCowBQYDK2VwAyEAmQgzNnSKJYuFWlr+ydjQPZYzENUGLcoj+vVpn7uA1SQ=
-----END PUBLIC KEY-----
